symbol source
lines 76 95
hash 8580f42fb6df404f
note The rows. Insets::start turns the scroll offset into the first line and first comment in view and emits the spacer above them; Insets::plan lists the code segments and comment boxes that fill the view; draw_plan draws them; then a spacer for the rest plus a row of slack, so the scrollbar sees the whole file, comments included, while only what shows is drawn. The bar closure marks the selected tour's anchors in this file, the background closure the selected lines, then lines under a comment.

