file crates/gui/src/views/center.rs
symbol scroll_to_request
lines 0 14
hash 89f8266b0cca6112
note A pending scroll: anything that selected a symbol or opened a line left a LineRequest in Nav, and it becomes a scroll offset three rows above that line, counting the height of every comment drawn above it, clamped to the file. The viewport height comes from what the column measured last frame. The request carries a ticket, and ScrolledToLine clears it only if no newer request replaced it meanwhile.

